    "summary": {
      "en": "Sogdian Marakanda, taken by Alexander, grew into the hub of Silk Road trade, was destroyed by Genghis Khan in 1220 and rebuilt by Timur as his imperial capital, whose Registan and mausolea are among the masterpieces of Islamic architecture.",
      "zh": "粟特的马拉坎达曾被亚历山大攻占，后发展为丝绸之路贸易的枢纽；1220年被成吉思汗摧毁，又被帖木儿重建为帝国都城，其雷吉斯坦广场和诸陵墓是伊斯兰建筑的杰作。"
    },
