      "en": "Capital of the Samanids and a famed centre of Islamic learning—Ibn Sina studied in its library—Bukhara survived the Mongol sack to become seat of the Shaybanid khans and the emirs of Bukhara until the Red Army took it in 1920.",
      "zh": "布哈拉是萨曼王朝的都城和著名的伊斯兰学术中心（伊本·西那曾在其图书馆求学），经蒙古洗劫后复兴，成为昔班尼汗国和布哈拉埃米尔的都城，直至1920年被红军攻占。"
